sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student / Reporter
    participant Inc as IncidentService (Stefania)
    participant Pub as ApplicationEventPublisher (Spring)
    participant List as LocalAssetDamagedListener (Calin)
    participant Reass as ReassignmentService (Calin)
    participant Cat as CatalogApi (Liviu)
    participant Res as ReservationApi / ReservationService (Calin)
    participant Strat as SubstituteStrategy (Calin)
    participant Log as ReassignmentLogRepository (Calin)
    participant Notif as NotificationService (Liviu)

    User->>Inc: reportIncident(assetId, description, photo)
    activate Inc
    Inc->>Cat: setOperationalStatus(assetId, UNDER_MAINTENANCE)
    Inc->>Pub: publishEvent(AssetDamagedEvent)
    Note over Inc,Pub: Incident transaction commits
    deactivate Inc

    Pub->>List: onAssetDamaged (AFTER_COMMIT)
    activate List
    List->>Reass: handleAssetDamaged(event)
    deactivate List

    activate Reass
    Note over Reass: @Transactional(REQUIRES_NEW)
    Reass->>Res: findUpcomingActiveByAsset(assetId)
    Res-->>Reass: List<ReservationSummary>

    loop For each upcoming reservation
        Reass->>Cat: getAsset(assetId)
        Cat-->>Reass: AssetSummary
        Reass->>Strat: findSubstitute(originalAsset, start, end)
        activate Strat
        Note over Strat: Strategy 1: SameModelStrategy (@Order 1)<br/>Strategy 2: SameCategoryStrategy (@Order 2)
        Strat->>Cat: findAvailableAssets(...)
        Cat-->>Strat: candidate assets
        Strat->>Res: findActiveReservationsForAssetBetween(...)
        Res-->>Strat: overlapping bookings
        Strat-->>Reass: Optional<AssetSummary>
        deactivate Strat

        alt Substitute asset found
            Reass->>Res: moveToAsset(reservationId, substituteAssetId)
            Reass->>Log: save(ReassignmentLog[status=REASSIGNED, strategy=...])
            Reass->>Notif: send(userId, "Reservation moved to substitute asset")
        else No substitute available
            Reass->>Res: forceCancel(reservationId)
            Reass->>Log: save(ReassignmentLog[status=CANCELLED, reason=NO_SUBSTITUTE_FOUND])
            Reass->>Notif: send(userId, "Reservation cancelled due to damaged asset")
        end
    end
    Note over Reass: Reassignment transaction commits
    deactivate Reass
